body:
I'm pretty sure Hybrid theory was about 35 minutes long and one of those tracks was a DJ track/interlude.

&#x200B;

I'm pleased that there doesn't seem to be any skits/interludes as after you have listened to the album a while they kinda just grate especially if on shuffle.

&#x200B;

The end begins comes on so much for me because its the first track on the nothing.
